and zstd (BSD-3-Clause), in addition to this project's LICENSE.

TensorFold (https://github.com/ashhart/TensorFold, by Ash Hart) is not included or linked. tfcuda implements the
CUDA driver API functions TensorFold resolves, and the tests run TensorFold's kernel images, which are not part of
this repository.
